---
import PhoneCTA from '../ui/PhoneCTA.astro';
import Eyebrow from '../ui/Eyebrow.astro';

interface Props {
  eyebrow?: string;
  headline?: string;
  bg?: 'white' | 'alabaster';
}

const { eyebrow, headline = "Repair or Replace? Make the Right Call.", bg = 'white' } = Astro.props;
const bgClass = bg === 'white' ? 'bg-white' : 'bg-brand-alabaster';
---

<section class={`py-16 md:py-24 border-b border-gray-100 ${bgClass}`}>
  <div class="max-w-[90rem] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 flex flex-col items-center">
      {eyebrow && <Eyebrow text={eyebrow} centered={true} />}
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-charcoal uppercase tracking-tight">{headline}</h2>
      <div class="w-24 h-1 bg-brand-accent mx-auto mt-6 mb-6"></div>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 font-sans leading-relaxed">Not sure if your garage door needs a simple fix or a complete overhaul? Here is how professionals evaluate the situation.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12">
      
      <!-- Repair Column -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-sm shadow-sm border-t-4 border-gray-300">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-charcoal mb-4">When to Repair</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6 font-sans">Repair is usually the best option when the door is structurally sound but a specific mechanical component has failed.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-4 font-sans text-gray-700">
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-green-600 mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
            <span>A torsion or extension spring has snapped.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-green-600 mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
            <span>The door has derailed but the panels are undamaged.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-green-600 mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
            <span>The opener motor hums but doesn't move (stripped gear).</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-green-600 mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
            <span>Only one panel is dented from a minor impact.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Replace Column -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-sm shadow-sm border-t-4 border-brand-accent">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-charcoal mb-4">When to Replace</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6 font-sans">Replacement makes financial sense when the door's structural integrity is compromised or the system is completely obsolete.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-4 font-sans text-gray-700">
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-accent mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"></path></svg>
            <span>Severe wood rot, widespread rust, or major warping.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-accent mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"></path></svg>
            <span>Multiple panels are crushed from a severe vehicle impact.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-accent mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"></path></svg>
            <span>The door lacks basic modern safety features and insulation.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-accent mr-3 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"></path></svg>
            <span>You need to drastically improve curb appeal for a home sale.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 text-center">
      <PhoneCTA label="Get a Professional Assessment" />
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
